   "slug": "marco-rubio-is-more-dangerous-than-pete-hegseth",
   "title": "Marco Rubio Is More Dangerous Than Pete Hegseth",
   "liveUrl": "https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/marco-rubio-is-more-dangerous-than-pete-hegseth.html",
   "archiveUrl": "https://web.archive.org/web/20251205103908/https://nymag.com/intelligencer/article/marco-rubio-is-more-dangerous-than-pete-hegseth.html",
