       "text": "If the Murdoch family does less business in Israel — the U.S., the U.K., and Australia are, for them, more lucrative — they remain fiercely supportive of the Jewish state and Netanyahu’s war in Gaza. The Murdoch-owned New York Post , along with Fox News, routinely smears pro-Palestine activists and venerates the Israeli military.",
       "links": []
