       "tag": "p",
       "text": "Laxalt has lashed Cortez Masto for high gas prices and the migrant crisis at the southern border. He celebrated the overturning of Roe in June. And he has a voter-registration advantage: Republicans and nonpartisans make up nearly 60 percent of the electorate. When Democrats do win in Nevada, their victories tend to be razor thin.",
